					"id": 760910704,
					"content": "Just look at all those facilities they built on Paha Isle, and the mechanical devices they brought in... That place used to be home to so many animals.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760910705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "???"
				},
				{
					"id": 760910705,
					"content": "I just got back from Maroon Basin. It must be because of the Fatui's machines, all the jellyfish there are barely hanging on... I have to let everyone know about this.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760910706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "???"
				},
				{
					"id": 760910706,
					"content": "So that's how it is...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760910709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760910709,
					"content": "Oh, and if you tell anyone else about this, make sure to say it was me, Semyon, who told you. After all, it's going to take a while before I can write it all up and publish it in the paper...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760910710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "???"
				},
				{
					"id": 760910710,
					"content": "I'll leave these notes with you for now. I need to hurry back and put everything else I've learned in order. I need to turn all this into an article.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760910701
					],
					"speakerTitle": "???"
				},
				{
					"id": 760910701,
					"content": "Anyway, thanks a lot! See you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "???"
				}
			]
		},
